# Local editor and tooling configuration. Machine-specific, reinstallable, and
# no more part of the project than node_modules is. Some of these are written
# automatically by `next dev` (see generate-agent-files.js), so they reappear on
# their own and must stay ignored rather than merely deleted.
#
# The architecture notes that belong to the project live in ARCHITECTURE.md,
# which IS committed.
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
debug.log
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json

